WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:03,660
Everyone will be trapped for life by the things they can’t get when they are young.

2
00:00:03,660 --> 00:00:05,940
Same thing

3
00:00:05,940 --> 00:00:11,030
It's time for you to sleep

4
00:00:11,030 --> 00:00:16,700
sleep later

5
00:00:16,700 --> 00:00:19,700
you are wasting time

6
00:00:19,700 --> 00:00:21,980
Just a waste of time

7
00:00:21,980 --> 00:00:25,340
Only then can you know that time cannot afford to be wasted

8
00:00:25,340 --> 00:00:30,380
I won’t waste time casually from now on.

9
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:31,380
Gu Shiyi

10
00:00:31,380 --> 00:00:32,380
thank you

11
00:00:32,380 --> 00:00:33,540
Thank you for what?

12
00:00:33,540 --> 00:00:37,900
I never thought I would sleep in the middle of nowhere

13
00:00:37,900 --> 00:00:38,900
Never thought about it

14
00:00:38,900 --> 00:00:42,900
The one with me will be a lion ghost style

15
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,990
There is also a young martial artist

16
00:00:44,990 --> 00:00:46,990
There are so many things that people can’t think of

17
00:00:46,990 --> 00:00:49,630
No one knows what the future will be like

18
00:00:49,630 --> 00:00:53,720
Is that why you live so seriously?

19
00:00:53,720 --> 00:00:55,880
you are afraid of the future

20
00:00:55,880 --> 00:00:59,350
i have never been afraid

21
00:00:59,350 --> 00:01:02,350
For me, living in the present is everything
